   "id": "MAPMES31:73ac6",
   "off": 473798,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "狭い牢の中で 女が鉄格子\rを蹴飛ばしている\u0010\b",
   "en": "In a cramped cell, a woman is kicking at the bars.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73af4",
