  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73b60",
   "off": 473952,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "グレイストーンは\r気合もろとも鉄格子を\rねじ曲げてしまった\u0010\b",
   "en": "With a mighty heave, Greystone wrenched the bars apart.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73b9c",
   "off": 474012,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73baf",
   "off": 474031,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "出てきたのは 酒場で\rアッシュと共にいた女だった\u0010\b",
   "en": "Out came the woman who had been with Ash at the tavern.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73be3",
   "off": 474083,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73be6",
   "off": 474086,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "女は どんどん\rグレイストーンを引っ張って\rいく\u0010\b",
   "en": "The woman marched off, hauling Greystone along behind her.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73c17",
   "off": 474135,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "フィンとリスプは\r顔を見合わせ あきれながら\r後を追った\u0010",
   "en": "Finn and Risp exchanged a look and followed, exasperated.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73c6b",
   "off": 474219,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "壁に山羊の印が\r彫りこまれている\u0010\b",
   "en": "A goat crest is carved into the wall.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73c98",
   "off": 474264,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES31:73c9b",
   "off": 474267,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "女は壁の彫刻をいじっている\u0010\b",
   "en": "The woman fiddled with the carving on the wall.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
